### 1. Check Health
GET http://172.28.170.233:8080/health

###

### 2. Post Logs (Ingest)
POST http://172.28.170.233:8080/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "logs": [
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-08-16T15:00:00Z",
      "level": "error",
      "service": "checkout",
      "message": "payment declined",
      "attributes": {
        "user_id": "42",
        "region": "eu-west",
        "retries": 3
      }
    }
  ]
}

###

### 3. Query Logs
GET http://172.28.170.233:8080/logs?service=checkout&limit=10

###

### 4. Aggregate Logs
GET http://172.28.170.233:8080/logs/aggregate?since=2026-08-01T00:00:00Z&until=2026-08-30T00:00:00Z&bucket=1h&group_by=service